ent-PlushieBrightheart = brightheart plushie
    .desc = A plushie of a small, elusive, and odd looking security officer. Seems familiar somehow.
ent-PlushieChemmi = chemmi plushie
    .desc = An adorable plushie of the orange juice addicted senior researcher Chemmi. She comes equipped with her own XL orange juice bottle, and jam-jar glasses to match.
ent-PlushieDoxes = doxes-the-captain plushie
    .desc = An adorable stuffed toy that resembles Doxes-the-Captain. "Captain's IP is 189.47.108.519!"
ent-PlushieEinalia = einalia plushie
    .desc = A marketable plushie of one of the shortest Captains in NT-CC employ, and Nebula's husband. The two amber eyes on its face feel as if they're boring into your soul.
ent-PlushieGalio = galio plushie
    .desc = Carry with you to feel silly wherever you go!
ent-PlushieHrek = hrekrativi plushie
    .desc = Has probably built more civilian infrastructure than any engineer you'll come across. Smells like space cleaner... and missing permits.
ent-PlushieKoni = koni plushie
    .desc = Some sort of moth-cat hybrid. You can't help but find it really cute. Can squeak and meow!
ent-PlushieLance = lance plushie
    .desc = Turning a quartermaster into a marketable plushie was not as profitable a venture as many in the cargo department had hoped.
ent-PlushieLinari = linari miun plushie
    .desc = An expertly crafted plush lizard in tactical officer gear, absent from the standard NanoTrasen catalogues. The stitching on the back says "Property of the Syndicate." Holding it makes you feel like you're breaking at least three corporate regulations.
ent-PlushieMozan = mozan plushie
    .desc = Just like the real thing, it squeaks if you poke it.
ent-PlushieNebula = nebula plushie
    .desc = A marketable plushie of Nebula Silverfeather- lovable pop star turned CC official. Husband not included.
ent-PlushieOp = op plushie
    .desc = bnuny... human?
ent-PlushieVictor = victor jr. plushie
    .desc = Junior's marketable attempt at making chefs reconsider using kobolds as a food source. It looks tasty though...
ent-PlushieAbductor = alien grey plushie
    .desc = A silent grey alien with big black eyes, a staple of retro sci-fi where they kidnap and experiment on unsuspecting people. Thank goodness they're not real!
ent-PlushieAxolotl = axolotl plushie
    .desc = Head empty. Absolutely zero thoughts behind their eyes.
ent-PlushieBorb = borb plushie
    .desc = Chonky. Rotund. Orb.
ent-PlushieBorg = borg plushie
    .desc = A tiny plushie of an engineering cyborg, complete with itty-bitty plastic tools.
ent-PlushieCowSquishims = cow squishims
    .desc = Round and soft and legally distinct!
ent-PlushieCreature = creature plushie
    .desc = YIPPIE!
ent-PlushieFrogSquishims = frog squishims
    .desc = Round and soft and legally distinct!
ent-PlushieGoat = goat plushie
    .desc = The best boy, the softest boy.
ent-PlushieGnome = gnome plushie
    .desc = Rattles when you shake it. Smells like Fooberries.
ent-PlushieKiki = Kiki plushie
    .desc = An honorable member of the kob... wait a minute, this is just a cute marketable plushie of Kiki!
ent-PlushieKitten = kitten plushie
    .desc = A blue kitten! Just like they raise on Vernethauz II!
ent-PlushiePanda = panda plushie
    .desc = Large and in charge! Its paws and body are weighted with poly pellets. Holding it eases your stress and anxieties.
ent-PlushiePig = pig plushie
    .desc = Head? Round. Eyes? Filled with optimism. Smells kinda like bacon.
ent-PlushieRenault = renault plushie
    .desc = The Captain's trusty pet! The tail is so fluffy.
ent-PlushieSaltLampLarge = large salt lamp plushie
    .desc = Larger safe version of everyone's favorite salt lamp.
ent-PlushieSaltLampSmall = small salt lamp plushie
    .desc = Small, safe version of everyone's favorite salt lamp.
ent-PlushieSeaBunny = sea bunny plushie
    .desc = A squishy bunny, looks like it wants to be worn!
ent-PlushieShadekin = shadekin plushie
    .desc = A plushie of a Shadekin. It's very soft.
ent-PlushieLargeSoftShark = large blue shark soft plushie
    .desc = A large, soft, and cuddly shark plushie. Perfect for hugging!
ent-PlushieSnail = snail plushie
    .desc = Look at it go!
ent-PlushieSus = sus plushie
    .desc = Fell out of a vent and into your heart. With a knife. It stabbed you (in the heart).
